Films accepted through the admin queue are written here, one JSON file per film,
by the Worker's publish flow (it opens a pull request). The build merges them
with data/movies.ndjson — see src/lib/db.js.

They are kept separate rather than appended to movies.ndjson because that file is
14 MB, over GitHub's 1 MB Contents API read limit, so the Worker cannot
read-modify-write it. One file per addition also keeps PR diffs readable.
